msgid "A system update is ready. Restart the computer to finish installing it."
msgstr "Una mesa a jorn del sistèma es prèsta. Reaviatz l'ordenador per acabar de l'installar."

msgid "System files need repair. This happens automatically the next time the computer restarts."
msgstr "De fichièrs del sistèma devon èsser reparats. Se farà automaticament a la propdana reaviada de l'ordenador."

msgid "The web browser is not installed yet."
msgstr "Lo navegador web es pas encara installat."

msgid "The web browser is ready. Sign out and sign in again to see it."
msgstr "Lo navegador web es prèst. Desconnectatz-vos e tornatz vos connectar per lo veire."

msgid "This app is not available on this device"
msgstr "Aquesta aplicacion es pas disponibla sus aqueste aparelh"

msgid "This app's lock settings are not in effect, so it cannot start. Please ask your teacher."
msgstr "Los paramètres de verrolhatge d'aquesta aplicacion son pas aplicats, doncas pòt pas aviar. Demandatz a vòstre ensenhaire."

msgid "Could not end your session. Please sign out and open this app from the sign-in screen."
msgstr "Impossible de tampar vòstra session. Desconnectatz-vos e dobrissètz aquesta aplicacion a partir de l'ecran de connexion."

msgid "This will end your session and open %s in locked mode."
msgstr "Aquò tamparà vòstra session e dobrirà %s en mòde verrolhat."

msgid "Newer settings could not be fetched. Please contact IT."
msgstr "Impossible de recuperar de paramètres mai recents. Contactatz l'informatica."

msgid "Settings have not been confirmed up to date for %s days. Please connect to the network; if this persists, contact IT."
msgstr "Dempuèi %s jorns, res confirma pas que los paramètres son a jorn. Connectatz-vos al ret ; se contunha, contactatz l'informatica."

msgid "IT is collecting diagnostic info from this computer."
msgstr "Lo servici informatic recampa d'informacions de diagnostic d'aqueste ordenador."
